8450678", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127509496", "personaname": "James.D.Hesper", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127509496/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 925, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 250, "last_played": 1740365111, "avatar": "a7036d2beed9c9c3e843e42352970bdadf0a29c8"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game. Real hard. Super fun with ppl.", "timestamp_created": 1740180935, "timestamp_updated": 1740180935, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188450586", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090659624", "personaname": "Vilonous", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090659624/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 909, "last_played": 1787605394, "avatar": "20b5cc7655e2231c62534591da67b3fcf95b80c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "We started playing Risk of Rain 2 for one simple reason: ARK: Survival Evolved multiplayer is awful. Trying to connect with friends felt like solving a puzzle designed by someone who actively hates joy. After enough failed attempts, we decided it was time for something new—something that actually worked. Enter Risk of Rain 2.\r\n\r\nRight away, it was a total game-changer. Smooth multiplayer that actually functions (what a concept), and within minutes, we were dropped into a wild, alien world where the goal is simple: survive as long as possible while everything around you tries to end your run. And it’s a blast.\r\n\r\nThe gameplay loop is addictive in the best way. You start off weak and scrambling for gear, but as the items stack up, you turn into a powerhouse. There’s something incredibly satisfying about going from barely scraping by to wiping out entire waves of enemies with a single attack. Every run feels fresh, and the chaos scales perfectly the longer you last.\r\n\r\nThe best part? Playing with friends feels effortless and actually fun. No connection issues, no weird bugs—just pure, chaotic co-op action. Plus, the soundtrack is surprisingly epic, making every boss fight feel way more intense than it has any right to be.\r\n\r\nIn short, Risk of Rain 2 is everything we wanted from a multiplayer game after the ARK disaster. It’s fun, challenging, and—most importantly—it works.", "timestamp_created": 1740180854, "timestamp_updated": 1740180854, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188450405", "author": {"steamid": "76561199211934993", "personaname": "bassyboy405", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199211934993/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 32629, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 337, "playtime_at_review": 2810, "last_played": 1789275275, "avatar": "942ae02d6a3d10a91743e1c0ce0118da57119726"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1740180672, "timestamp_updated": 1740180672, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}